======================================================================
Third-party source code included (rewritten extraction, Apache-2.0)
======================================================================

BOOP's Taskboard client components are a REWRITTEN extraction of the upstream
project below. They are not verbatim copies; each file was re-implemented
against BOOP's own task/ledger facts and its frozen UI rules.

  Upstream repository : chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard
  Fixed commit        : 723c400eec86c454c1ffa56ee1b500746d41e142
  Upstream license    : Apache License, Version 2.0
                        (https://github.com/chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard/blob/723c400eec86c454c1ffa56ee1b500746d41e142/LICENSE)
  Upstream NOTICE     : none in the upstream repository root at that commit

  Imported as rewritten extraction:
    web/src/components/BoardColumn.tsx  -> src/client/taskboard/BoardColumn.tsx
    web/src/components/TaskCard.tsx     -> src/client/taskboard/TaskCard.tsx
    web/src/components/IssueListView.tsx-> src/client/taskboard/IssueListView.tsx
    web/src/taskFilters.ts              -> src/client/taskboard/view-model.ts (filter section)
    web/src/types.ts                    -> src/client/taskboard/view-model.ts (field-shape reference only)

  Modifications (declared):
    - columns are driven by BOOP's four derived display groups instead of the
      upstream single status; task facts come from BOOP's own ledger API;
    - all drag/drop, upstream Codex API/actors/taskConversations, attachment URL
      resolution, Markdown pipeline, i18n, icon and brand assets were removed;
    - keyboard/menu alternatives and scoped [data-boop-taskboard] styles added;
    - React stays a host-provided platform module (never bundled).
    See the repository's docs/development/taskboard-sources.md for the
    file-by-file register.

