Visual assets (user-provided, not third-party open source)
======================================================================

  - The BOOP character design, the 3D model, its five state images and the
    WebGL2 player shipped under assets/3d were provided by the project owner.
    They are copied unmodified from the owner-provided asset pack
    "BOOP_3D_Animation_v0.1" (GLB SHA-256
    379e9845c597681f53b90e851bcb88ee31a01a1ace80b3e63478539f4807b56b).
    That asset pack states it contains no third-party character meshes,
    textures, fonts or JavaScript runtime libraries.
  - The approved 2D visual baseline used to design the character is kept in
    the internal design repository and is NOT part of this distribution.
  - No third-party brand, icon, font or screenshot asset is bundled in this
    distribution.

